# Pairing (section 8.1), RIGHT half: it opens the same screen and does nothing else.
#
# Selecting on one device pairs only that device -- the filter is per device, and the pair goes on
# working with one half still open to anyone. This instance is what makes the harness able to say
# so: it is discovered, it discovers, and its own settings file must come out with no paired MAC in
# it at all.
log pageflip-pairing-right: start
expect_timeout 90000
expect Entering activity: Home
wait 1000
tap down
tap down
tap down
tap down
wait 500
tap confirm
expect Entering activity: Settings
wait 1500
tap confirm
wait 800
tap up
wait 800
tap confirm
expect Entering activity: PageFlipPairing
wait 4000
screenshot /screenshots/pf-pairing-right-00.bmp
# Stays on the screen while the other half chooses, then leaves without choosing anything.
wait 6000
log pageflip-pairing-right: done
quit
